WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.035
-Welcome back to "Late Night."
We are back here with Lorde.

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:05.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
To be honest, how hungover
were you the next day?

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:07.307 line:92%
-[ Exhales sharply, laughs ]

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:08.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
I almost can't
even talk about it.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:10.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
I can't look at an alcoholic
drink ever again.

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:12.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was insane.
-I was -- We filmed this

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:14.447
last Monday, and then on Tuesday
you were on

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:15.682 align:start size:94% position:6%
"The Late Show
with Stephen Colbert,"

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:19.219
and I watched that very nervou
that I had somehow taken you out

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:20.620 align:start size:94% position:6%
so late that
you would not perform well

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
but you were wonderful
on that show.

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:23.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
You did kind of destroy me

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:27.827 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I had to get a very
pop-star thing, an IV drip

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:29.896 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You didn't.
-Someone came to my hotel

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:34.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
and administered fluids
to my corpse.

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:37.737
-You kids and the things you do.
-The tick.

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:41.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know? [ Indistinct ]
The IV tick.

